The data files in lunasrim/data (SCOEF03.DAT, SNUC03.dat, ATOMDATA and
Compound.dat) are part of SRIM-2013 by J. F. Ziegler, J. P. Biersack and
M. D. Ziegler (www.srim.org). They are not covered by the MIT license above
and remain under the terms of their authors. SRIM itself is not distributed
